yle=\"margin: 1.4em 0px 0px; color: rgb(25, 27, 31); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Helvetica Neue\', \'PingFang SC\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', \'Source Han Sans SC\', \'Noto Sans CJK SC\', \'WenQuanYi Micro Hei\', \'MiSans L3\', \'Segoe UI\', sans-serif; font-size: medium; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">合同签订日期： 年 月 日</p>', '<p data-first-child=\"\" data-pid=\"xyt-2eDc\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 1.4em; color: rgb(25, 27, 31); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Helvetica Neue\', \'PingFang SC\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', \'Source Han Sans SC\', \'Noto Sans CJK SC\', \'WenQuanYi Micro Hei\', \'MiSans L3\', \'Segoe UI\', sans-serif; font-size: medium; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><b style=\"font-weight: 600;\">借款合同模板如下，含出借人、借款人及保证人。码字不易，请点赞+收藏+关注，提供格式完整、美观word版，同时将提供合同使用方法~~<br>借</b><span>&nbsp;</span><b style=\"font-weight: 600;\">款</b><span>&nbsp;</span><b style=\"font-weight: 600;\">合</b><span>&nbsp;</span><b style=\"font-weight: 600;\">同</b></p>\n<p data-pid=\"B8JxR2-I\" style=\"margin: 1.4em 0px; color: rgb(25, 27, 31); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Helvetica Neue\', \'PingFang SC\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', \'Source Han Sans SC\', \'Noto Sans CJK SC\', \'WenQuanYi Micr